  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a bain-marie to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Place the pork sausage on bamboo skewers, if using, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill the pork sausage for 2-3 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, cook the rice noodles according to the package instructions.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the fish sauce, soy sauce, hoisin sauce, grated ginger, garlic, and black pepper.",
    "Toss the cooked noodles with the sauce mixture, to taste.",
    "Slice the cooked pork sausage into thin rounds.",
    "Arrange the noodles, pork sausage, and provolone cheese in an earthenware bowl.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve with a lime wedge on the side."
  ],
